GenAISingleLayoutViewModel\\\"}},{\\\"view_model\\\":{\\\"primitive\\\":{\\\"text\\\":\\\"We have *only one axis*, it explains 100\\\\u0025 of the inertia.\\\\n\\\\n### 4. Chi-square distance of Town and Village to the average profile\\\\n\\\\nFormula: {{IE_37}}$d^2(i, G) = \\\\\\\\sum_j \\\\\\\\frac{(profile_{ij} - \\\\\\\\bar{profile}_j)^2}{\\\\\\\\bar{profile}_j}${{\\\\\\\/IE_37}}\\\\n\\\\n*For Town:*\\\",\\\"inline_entities\\\":[{\\\"key\\\":\\\"IE_37\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"latex_image\\\":{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\\/\\\\\\\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\\\\\\\/v\\\\\\\/t58.90637-6\\\\\\\/913356889_1137601895910383_580372280484536594_n.png\\\\\\\/latex.png?_nc_ht=scontent.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=111&_nc_ohc=KxAgltbsKrcQ7kNvwFadn3l&ccb=14-4&oh=00_AQTjNLm7IeDh6P0vvIP5JwE5BZ8-8NXwEx3tn7KOUIcSSA&oe=6AFF48A4&_nc_sid=9d332d\\\",\\\"url_fallback\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\\/\\\\\\\/web.facebook.com\\\\\\\/messaging\\\\\\\/lightspeed\\\\\\\/media_fallback\\\\\\\/?entity_id=1472835998306264&entity_type=58\\\",\\\"mime_type\\\":\\\"image\\\\\\\/png\\\",\\\"expiration_timestamp_ms\\\":\\\"1795115172000\\\",\\\"width\\\":1070,\\\"height\\\":230},\\\"latex_expression\\\":\\\"d^2(i, G) = \\\\\\\\sum_j \\\\\\\\frac{(profile_{ij} - \\\\\\\\bar{profile}_j)^2}{\\\\\\\\bar{profile}_j}\\\",\\\"font_height\\\":83.333333333333,\\\"padding\\\":15,\\\"baseline_from_bottom\\\":112.35503472222,\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"GenAILatexItem\\\"}}],\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"GenAIMarkdownTextUXPrimitive\\\"},\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"GenAISingleLayoutViewModel\\\"}},{\\\"view_model\\\":{\\\"primitive\\\":{\\\"latex_image\\\":{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\\/\\\\\\\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\\\\\\\/v\\\\\\\/t58.90637-6\\\\\\\/915920671_1518801906962381_8845210012700080866_n.png\\\\\\\/latex.png?_nc_ht=scontent.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=105&_nc_ohc=Cfl_AyLcXVkQ7kNvwFyP-N2&ccb=14-4&oh=00_AQR9x5rN9LDyEURoHKBC7_KHY5WSbNJteGzruN8r8BFTrA&oe=6AFF72C2&_nc_sid=9d332d\\\",\\\"url_fallback\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\\/\\\\\\\/web.facebook.com\\\\